      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Other guidance relevant to this area",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Light touch contracts",
        "Other guidance relevant to this area"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities awarding light touch contracts will need to understand the whole of the Act, as the same provisions (for example, relating to competitive tendering procedures, conditions of participation and award criteria) as apply to contracting authorities awarding other contracts apply.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Light touch contracts",
        "Other guidance relevant to this area"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The following guidance is of particular relevance in determining whether a contract will be governed by the provisions in the Act for light touch contracts:",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Light touch contracts",
        "Other guidance relevant to this area"
      ],
